{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04252","headline":"远使海曲春夜多怀 · 骆宾王","name":"远使海曲春夜多怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长啸三春晚，端居百虑盈。\n未安胡蝶梦，遽切鲁禽情。\n别岛连寰海，离魂断戍城。\n流星疑伴使，低月似依营。\n怀禄宁期达，牵时匪狥名。\n艰虞行已远，时迹自相惊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04252.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04252","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}